# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings.
#
# This machine has core.autocrlf enabled, which rewrites text files to CRLF on
# checkout. That is harmless for Java sources, and fatal for two things here:
#
#   scripts/api-tour.sh          run by bash - CRLF makes the shebang invalid
#   docker/wildfly/configure.cli read by jboss-cli inside a Linux container
#
# Normalising the whole tree to LF avoids having to remember which files are
# which, and matches what the Docker images expect.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

*.war binary
*.jar binary
*.png binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Language statistics.
#
# tutorial.html is a single 2.5 MB generated course page. On its own it
# outweighed the 1.2 MB of Java under src/, so GitHub labelled this repository
# "HTML" and the Jakarta EE work did not show up in the language bar or in
# language-filtered search.
#
# linguist-documentation keeps the page served and versioned, but leaves it
# out of the language stats.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
src/main/resources/static/tutorial.html linguist-documentation
